			"notes": "## Quick Resource Pack 2.0\n\nA full rewrite. Same idea, much more of it.\n\n**New**\n- **Pack Wheel:** hold R to pick a pack from a wheel, or bind a key that opens it.\n- **Slots:** as many packs as you like, each with its own key, including Shift, Ctrl and Alt combos.\n- **Three modes:** Toggle (add on top), Profile (swap your whole pack list), Cycle (step through packs).\n- **Rules:** turn slots on by themselves on a server, in a world or in a dimension.\n- **No loading screen:** packs load in the background while you keep playing, with a progress toast.\n- **New menu** in Minecraft's own style, also reachable from a button on the Resource Packs screen.\n- **Commands:** `/qrp`, `/qrp toggle <slot>`, `/qrp wheel`, `/qrp list`, `/qrp reload`, `/qrp where`.\n- **Optional on-screen pack icons**, like status effects.\n\n**Changed**\n- Cloth Config is no longer needed. Mod Menu is optional.\n- Your 1.x pack, key and settings are moved over automatically.\n- Keys no longer fire while you hold F3 for a debug shortcut.\n\n**Requires** Minecraft 26.1 to 26.3, Fabric Loader and Fabric API. Players on 1.21.x can keep using 1.1.1."
		}
